    "description": "<p><strong>SCREE</strong></p>\n<p><em>Your compound eyes have developed extraordinary peripheral awareness, allowing very little movement to escape your attention.</em></p>\n<p>The racial bonus granted by your Compound Eyes ability to visual Perception checks increases from +1 to +2. Furthermore, you gain a +10 racial bonus to Initiative checks.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> +10 racial to initiative, and Compound Eyes' own tick (visual Perception) becomes +2 instead of +1 while you have this feat; removing the feat puts it back.</p>",
